{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56332","headline":"月波亭观书 · 周如锡","name":"月波亭观书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"痴儿事未了，山照已衔西。\n数曲寻江路，层空步石梯。\n栖高得月早，壁峭与天齐。\n往矣初寮躅，摩挲旧碣题。\n（见上海图书馆藏胶卷复制康熙六年刊蒋士昌纂《永明县志》卷十二。\n）（按：《题古寺》署「唐周如鍉，太守」，《月波亭观书》署「唐周如锡，刺史」，显爲一人，然未详孰是，今并存之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周如锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56332.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56332","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}